%SIXMD 1
# @?DEVS - LIST DEVICES

## DESCRIPTION

DEVS LISTS THE CURRENT /DEV DIRECTORY USING THE SAME COMPACT TYPE PREFIXES AS
LS.
USAGE IS 'DEVS'.

## @?FILES

### @?/DEV
DEVICE NAMESPACE TO LIST.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
